{title: Crowded Chords}
{artist: chordpro-live test fixture}
{key: G}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Cmaj7]I [G/B]am [Am7]a [D7sus4]song [Em]
With [F#m7b5]chords [B7]on [Em]short [Em/D]words
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Every [D]chord [G]stays [Gsus4]put [G]
[Am]Over [Bm7]its [C]own [D]sound
{end_of_chorus}
